      "title": "Postal Votes Can Be Hand Delivered to Polling Stations Today",
      "slug": "postal-votes-can-be-hand-delivered-to-polling-stations-today",
      "excerpt": "Voters in Heywood, Middleton, and Rochdale can hand deliver their postal votes to polling stations before 10pm today, 30 July.",
      "content_html": "<p>A postal vote can be hand delivered to any polling station in Heywood, Middleton, Pennines, and Rochdale before 10pm today, Thursday 30 July.</p><p>Voters who have not returned their postal votes are advised to complete a Postal Vote Return Form when delivering their ballot.</p><p>This option is available to ensure that those who may have forgotten to send their postal votes can still participate in the election process.</p><p>Polling stations will remain open until the deadline, allowing voters to ensure their votes are counted.</p>",
